<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NQU2026 Options Structure & Gamma Dashboard</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #3A0B10 0%, #121214 100%);
            --primary-red: #E50914;
            --secondary-crimson: #990000;
            --card-bg: #1E1E22;
            --card-border: #2E2E34;
            --btn-fill: #2B2B30;
            --btn-hover: linear-gradient(135deg, #3D3D45 0%, #5B181B 100%);
            --btn-text: #EFEFEF;
            --text-primary: #FAFAFA;
            --text-muted: #75757C;
            --input-bg: #161618;
            --input-border: #2D2D35;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: qlineargradient(x1:0, y1:0, x2:1, y2:1, stop:0 #4A0E13, stop:0.6 #1A080A, stop:1 #0F0F12);
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3A0B10 0%, #121214 100%);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .dashboard-container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        header {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .title-group h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .title-group p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .spot-badge {
            background: var(--input-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary-red);
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-end;
            animation: pulse-border 1200ms infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        .spot-badge .label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .spot-badge .value {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary-red);
        }

        .grid-layout {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 24px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .grid-layout {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .card-full {
            grid-column: span 2;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .card-full {
                grid-column: span 1;
            }
        }

        .card h2 {
            font-size: 1.125rem;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .regime-text {
            font-size: 0.938rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #D1D1D6;
        }

        .levels-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .levels-table th, .levels-table td {
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            font-size: 0.875rem;
        }

        .levels-table th {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
        }

        .levels-table tr:hover {
            background: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.04);
        }

        .call-wall { color: #FF6B6B; font-weight: 600; }
        .put-wall { color: #4CD137; font-weight: 600; }
        .flip-level { color: #FBC531; font-weight: 600; }
        .anchor-level { color: var(--primary-red); font-weight: 600; }

        .breakdown-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .breakdown-item {
            background: var(--input-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--input-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 16px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: border-color 180ms ease-in-out;
        }

        .breakdown-item:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary-red);
        }

        .breakdown-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .breakdown-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.938rem;
        }

        .breakdown-oi {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            background: #202025;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .breakdown-desc {
            font-size: 0.813rem;
            color: #A1A1AA;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .interactive-controls {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .btn {
            background: var(--btn-fill);
            color: var(--btn-text);
            border: 1px solid #3E3E46;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 180ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: var(--btn-hover);
            border-color: var(--primary-red);
        }

        .btn:active {
            background: #1A1A1E;
            border-color: var(--secondary-crimson);
        }

        .input-field {
            background: var(--input-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--input-border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            width: 100%;
            transition: border-color 180ms ease-in-out;
        }

        .input-field:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary-red);
        }

        .progress-bar-container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 6px;
            background: #2B2B30;
            border-radius: 3px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        .progress-bar-fill {
            width: 65%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2B2B30 0%, var(--primary-red) 50%, #2B2B30 100%);
            background-size: 200% 100%;
            animation: progress-pulse 2000ms infinite linear;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-border {
            0% { border-color: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.4); }
            50% { border-color: rgba(229, 9, 20, 1.0); }
            100% { border-color: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.4); }
        }

        @keyframes progress-pulse {
            0% { background-position: 100% 0; }
            100% { background-position: -100% 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="dashboard-container">
        
        <header>
            <div class="title-group">
                <h1>NQU2026 Options Structure & Gamma Monitor</h1>
                <p>Institutional Order Flow & Volatility Surface Intelligence</p>
            </div>
            <div class="spot-badge">
                <span class="label">Spot Price Anchor</span>
                <span class="value">29,420.00</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="card" style="padding: 16px 24px; gap: 8px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                <span>GAMMA EQUILIBRIUM FLUIDITY</span>
                <span>NET-POSITIVE REGIME ACTIVE</span>
            </div>
            <div class="progress-bar-container">
                <div class="progress-bar-fill"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-layout">
            
            <div class="card">
                <h2>Options Chain Boundaries</h2>
                <table class="levels-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Classification</th>
                            <th>Strike Level</th>
                            <th>Structural Role</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="call-wall">Primary Call Wall</td>
                            <td>30,100.00</td>
                            <td>Heavy passive limit-ask stacking / Call-writing overlay</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="call-wall">Secondary Call Wall</td>
                            <td>29,800.00</td>
                            <td>High delta-notional turnover / Profit-taking zone</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="call-wall">Minor Resistance</td>
                            <td>29,600.00</td>
                            <td>High-frequency scalping node</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="anchor-level">Spot Anchor</td>
                            <td>29,420.00</td>
                            <td>Session POC / 35% total volume node</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="flip-level">Zero-Gamma Flip</td>
                            <td>29,350.00</td>
                            <td>Critical structural tripwire / Sign boundary</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="put-wall">Minor Support</td>
                            <td>29,300.00</td>
                            <td>Passive bid absorption zone</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="put-wall">Secondary Put Wall</td>
                            <td>29,100.00</td>
                            <td>Transitional liquidity shelf / CTA stop triggers</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="primary-wall">Primary Put Wall</td>
                            <td>28,800.00</td>
                            <td>Major structural shelf / Short-put gamma liability</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2>Market Regime & Dealer Gamma Impact</h2>
                <div class="regime-text">
                    <p>The NQU2026 options structure operates within a <strong>net-positive gamma regime</strong>, anchored just above the <strong>Zero-Gamma Flip level of 29,350</strong>. In this configuration, options market makers are net-short gamma and maintain long underlying index/futures delta hedges to neutralize their books.</p>
                    <br>
                    <p>This creates a mechanical, mean-reverting intraday feedback loop: as spot pushes toward the <strong>29,600 minor call wall</strong>, dealers aggressively sell underlying futures into rallies to trim excess delta. Conversely, as price dips toward the <strong>29,300 minor put wall</strong>, dealers buy underlying futures to replenish declining delta, compressing realized volatility and pinning spot within a narrow intraday distribution band.</p>
                    <br>
                    <p><strong>Structural Vulnerability:</strong> A sustained breach below the 29,350 Zero-Gamma Flip transforms dealers from a stabilizing force into a pro-cyclical source of momentum, compelling market makers to chase downward price action toward the 29,100 secondary and 28,800 primary put walls.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="interactive-controls">
                    <input type="text" class="input-field" placeholder="Enter target strike query...">
                    <button class="btn">Query DOM</button>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="card card-full">
            <h2>Volume & Open Interest Structural Breakdown</h2>
            <div class="breakdown-grid">
                
                <div class="breakdown-item">
                    <div class="breakdown-header">
                        <span class="breakdown-title call-wall">Primary Call Wall (30,100.00)</span>
                        <span class="breakdown-oi">54,200 Contracts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="breakdown-desc">
                        Concentrated across September expiration 30,100 and 30,200 strikes. Thin TPO volume node with heavy passive limit-ask stacking on the DOM, absorbing aggressive market buy orders.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="breakdown-item">
                    <div class="breakdown-header">
                        <span class="breakdown-title call-wall">Secondary Call Wall (29,800.00)</span>
                        <span class="breakdown-oi">41,800 Contracts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="breakdown-desc">
                        Intermediate volume cluster exhibiting high delta-notional turnover. CVD turns negative on tests of this boundary due to institutional block selling and long futures profit-taking.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="breakdown-item">
                    <div class="breakdown-header">
                        <span class="breakdown-title call-wall">Minor Resistance Call Wall (29,600.00)</span>
                        <span class="breakdown-oi">31,500 Contracts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="breakdown-desc">
                        High-frequency scalping node with rapid rotation. Intraday tape shows balanced aggressive participation, with short-gamma scalpers actively leaning on bids and offers.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="breakdown-item">
                    <div class="breakdown-header">
                        <span class="breakdown-title anchor-level">Current Spot Anchor (29,420.00)</span>
                        <span class="breakdown-oi">38,900 Contracts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="breakdown-desc">
                        Aggregated across 29,400 and 29,500 straddles/strangles. High-volume POC for the New York session (>35% session volume). CVD oscillates narrowly around baseline equilibrium.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="breakdown-item">
                    <div class="breakdown-header">
                        <span class="breakdown-title flip-level">Zero-Gamma Flip Level (29,350.00)</span>
                        <span class="breakdown-oi">24,100 Contracts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="breakdown-desc">
                        Low-liquidity air pocket on the volume profile. Tape exhibits sudden sweeps and wider bid-ask spreads, acting as an acute structural tripwire where execution slippage scales exponentially.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="breakdown-item">
                    <div class="breakdown-header">
                        <span class="breakdown-title put-wall">Minor Support Put Wall (29,300.00)</span>
                        <span class="breakdown-oi">29,400 Contracts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="breakdown-desc">
                        Local volume node displaying aggressive passive bid absorption. Limit-order book data highlights layered resting buy limits defending against downside drift.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="breakdown-item">
                    <div class="breakdown-header">
                        <span class="breakdown-title put-wall">Secondary Put Wall (29,100.00)</span>
                        <span class="breakdown-oi">46,700 Contracts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="breakdown-desc">
                        Significant low-volume node shelf acting as a transitional liquidity pocket. Order flow shows institutional put-buying hedges alongside systematic CTA trend-following stop losses.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="breakdown-item">
                    <div class="breakdown-header">
                        <span class="breakdown-title put-wall">Primary Put Wall (28,800.00)</span>
                        <span class="breakdown-oi">71,200 Contracts</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="breakdown-desc">
                        Major structural volume shelf underpinned by massive dealer short-put gamma liabilities. Displays heavy aggressive put-selling absorption and deep passive liquidity replenishment.
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
